<!-- FED-001 AC2: ONE item. The shape a graph sees must not depend on how many items a feed
     happened to carry, or every reader needs a branch it should never have needed.
     ⚠️ Two mechanisms could deliver that and only one does. A control run on 2026-09-18 removed
     `item`/`entry` from `FEED_ARRAY_TAGS` and this test stayed GREEN: the guarantee comes from
     `many()` in `src/feed.ts`, which wraps a lone object, NOT from the parser's `alwaysArray`.
     `alwaysArray` is what keeps `link`, `category` and `enclosure` consistent inside `raw`. -->
